{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a stapler positioned on the left side. The arrangement follows a specific pattern: for every game controller in the image, it is placed to the right of the stapler and aligned horizontally with it. Additionally, there is a lighter located to the right of each game controller, maintaining the same horizontal alignment.",
